    "body": "I really like that idea of showing the docker-compose run status.\r\n\r\nI think we could parse the `docker-compose.yml` file to get a list of containers and then compare that to the list of running containers from `docker-compose ps` to display something like `3/3` to show that 3 containers are running out of 3 expected. We could also  the text red or show some sort of alert icon if some of the containers aren't running.",
