    "body": "Yeah, I suspected that would be a problem.\r\n\r\nI am not very familiar with the design philosophy of the integrations in this project, but is there any way the status could be computed in the background, cached, and the prompt would just show the most recent cached value? You could set a timeout so that it only gets polled with some maximum frequency.\r\n\r\nI personally would still find that implementation (very) useful, but would understand if it isn't sufficiently consistent with the behavior of other integrations.",
